<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-03T09:46:53.115Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 09:46:53 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthis have advanced to within 80 km of Aden and intensified fighting in al-Jawf, making the governorate a new hotspot as government forces clash with them. A UN staff member died while in Houthi custody, prompting an investigation. The Saudi-led coalition intercepted a missile during the battles in al-Jawf. Iran negotiators left Qatar as a draft proposal to end the war circulated, linking regional diplomacy to the Yemen conflict. The war caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168703&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sportstar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE9OeTc1VE5lcEx0QzNhVlh6TnBVZUhfdi1MR0xZQnJOLWo2U3dHb09ucVhPNXctSTFXNTF6R3EwZEJXSl96SF9zS2FPUWFwcHpHeFVMaGtUckZiaGIydHc1SFMwT3U1R1h5WnMtY2RGUkdtYm1jV2VUMWFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFB6dWR6QWxyT2F0alI1dEpFVGlDaUQ4aEhlMENuRkZYeWt3c2lpbDdEXzNVT3dYT3NaQlE2SUtWZmsxMEMxS2pLMg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQYlRCZUUyWF9VckZ3NWJGbUV2Z3luSldoNGZIVk1zTkN4MEZ1ajdSZm4zYmNLYjhVbU5TQU9yYTU2YVVrSFY3QzNPU21wT2EwVlFlRG9mMGxkeG84RHptSzlsOUw3Zmd6SHRqZGdzM1UxQnpWZlZ4MFJSYTFTZ296c2U1T1NGZFBqd3hnazg3clVMUFJ4SWNzYUtjOVoxY2FHMHpzY3RKZkNudw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxONzRGVHdVb1U0ckxCRUZwZW5MX1hyZExrU0RwbFV3SEZfRVlzQ3dQRmJ2NFpiMEVHNFNfU1pXSlR0aEhPWkdlMGlMY0YxalNxNG4yeERHME9qWmJUc1hkVDJobVl1SHVsX3NlS1N6YWtHWnVqejdCQzNpOEZQMkotWWQxTkJIaHU0YWxhdmQ5aWhlSWFPNnd5RnZzZU83Q1VZa29udXdzbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;